{"id":"ch-f5bce17a275c","html":"<div class=\"prose\">         <span class=\"source-page\" style=\"background-color:#000000;color:inherit\"> <span class=\"source-ink\" style=\"color:#ffffff\">    <span class=\"dialogue\"><span class=\"dropcap\"><span class=\"strong\">猫</span></span>：（不安地自言自语着）这守门人，跑去哪里了？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（守门人拖着孤儿，正在一座教堂里漫步着。教堂的一处窗沿站着几只傻乎乎地探着头的鸽子。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>孤儿1：教授？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>孤儿2：（再次喊）教授！<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>孤儿1：我们这是去哪？我为什么在这里？你为什么这样拖着我？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（椅子下多了许多铁制十字架。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（孤儿1抄起其中一条十字架，砸向自己的头颅。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（孤儿2也开始重击自己的头颅。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……停止你们的所作所为！<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（窗沿的鸽子开始四处逃散。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：守门人，你这是在干什么？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……使者已寻回。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>孤儿1：什么使者，我们不是使者！放我们回家！<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：原来是使者吗？守门人，你可以把奖章交给我了；你的任务已经完成，回宫殿里休息吧。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……收到。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：那我的奖章呢？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：暂时还不能还给你。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（猫突然一跃而起，扑向狄利克雷；守门人前去把猫拽开。狄利克雷把守门人推开。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：守门人，立即拦住他们！<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……收到。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（孤儿们趁混乱之中逃之夭夭，离开了教堂。走到中途，他们突然跌落至无人之境，快速下坠着。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……来不及了。我的命运应该终结了。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（守门人掉头走回教堂。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（狄利克雷恼怒地把猫摔在一旁。）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：没有拦住吗？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>守门人：……没有。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>狄利克雷：很好……把你的头盔交给我吧。你的使命已经结束了。立即回宫殿反思！<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫：那我的奖章呢？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（狄利克雷重重地踹了猫一脚。猫躺倒在地上，呻吟着，同时不停地往门口后退着……）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>（狄利克雷却继续逼近着……）<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"illustration svg-illustration\" data-source-pdf=\"trebleclef.preview.pdf\"><img src=\"assets/pdf-svg/asset-c140cea8e6e6-1.svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"38\" alt=\"trebleclef.preview，第 1 页\" loading=\"lazy\"><a href=\"assets/asset-c140cea8e6e6.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">原 PDF · trebleclef.preview ↗</a></span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span></span></div>"}